    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#| label: get_data\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "import json\n",
        "import plotly.graph_objects as go\n",
        "from logic_diagram import create_logic_diagram_SmokeModel\n",
        "\n",
        "# Load session data from JSON\n",
        "with open(\"./outputs/session_data.json\", \"r\") as f:\n",
        "    session_data = json.load(f)\n",
        "\n",
        "data_no_mecc = pd.read_csv(\"./outputs/data_no_mecc.csv\")\n",
        "data_mecc = pd.read_csv(\"./outputs/data_mecc.csv\")"
      ],
      "id": "get_data",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Smoking Cessation with MECC\n",
        "\n",
        "## Simulation Results\n"
      ],
      "id": "e6652638"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#| label: plots\n",
        "from streamlit_model_functions import create_population_figure\n",
        "from streamlit_model_functions import create_intervention_figure\n",
        "from streamlit_model_functions import create_metrics_figure\n",
        "\n",
        "step = len(data_no_mecc) - 1\n",
        "fig1 = create_population_figure(data_no_mecc, data_mecc, step)\n",
        "fig1.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "fig2 = create_intervention_figure(data_no_mecc, data_mecc, step)\n",
        "fig2.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "fig3 = create_metrics_figure(data_no_mecc, data_mecc, step)\n",
        "fig3.show()"
      ],
      "id": "plots",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Final Statistics\n",
        "\n",
        "### Smoking Reduction (No MECC) "
      ],
      "id": "64b0c44f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#| label: Calculate smoking reduction for model without MECC\n",
        "initial_non_smokers_no_mecc = data_no_mecc['Total Not Smoking'].iloc[0]\n",
        "final_non_smokers_no_mecc = data_no_mecc['Total Not Smoking'].iloc[-1]\n",
        "reduction_no_mecc = (final_non_smokers_no_mecc / session_data[\"N_people\"]) * 100\n",
        "total_quits_no_mecc = final_non_smokers_no_mecc - initial_non_smokers_no_mecc\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Smoking Reduction (No MECC): {reduction_no_mecc:.1f}%\")\n",
        "print(f\"Total Quits (No MECC): {total_quits_no_mecc:.0f}\")"
      ],
      "id": "Calculate-smoking-reduction-for-model-without-MECC",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Smoking Reduction (With MECC) "
      ],
      "id": "22aed13a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#| label: Calculate smoking reduction for model with MECC\n",
        "initial_non_smokers_mecc = data_mecc['Total Not Smoking'].iloc[0]\n",
        "final_non_smokers_mecc = data_mecc['Total Not Smoking'].iloc[-1]\n",
        "reduction_mecc = (final_non_smokers_mecc / session_data[\"N_people\"]) * 100\n",
        "total_quits_mecc = final_non_smokers_mecc - initial_non_smokers_mecc\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Smoking Reduction (With MECC): {reduction_mecc:.1f}%\")\n",
        "print(f\"Total Quits (With MECC): {total_quits_mecc:.0f}\")"
      ],
      "id": "Calculate-smoking-reduction-for-model-with-MECC",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### MECC Impact\n"
      ],
      "id": "b625670b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#| label: Calculate additional quits due to MECC\n",
        "mecc_improvement = final_non_smokers_mecc - final_non_smokers_no_mecc\n",
        "mecc_impact_percentage = (mecc_improvement / session_data[\"N_people\"]) * 100\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"MECC Impact: {mecc_improvement:.0f} additional quits\")\n",
        "print(f\"MECC Impact Percentage: {mecc_impact_percentage:.1f}%\")"
      ],
      "id": "Calculate-additional-quits-due-to-MECC",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Toy MECC Parameters\n",
        "\n",
        "### Population Parameters\n",
        " - Number of People: **`{python} session_data[\"N_people\"]`** \n",
        " - Initial Smoking Probability: **`{python} session_data[\"initial_smoking_prob\"]`**\n",
        " - Chance of Visiting a Service per Month: **`{python} session_data[\"visit_prob\"]`**\n",
        " - Base Quit Attempt Probability per Month: **`{python} session_data[\"quit_attempt_prob\"]`**\n",
        " - Base Smoking Relapse per Month: **`{python} session_data[\"base_smoke_relapse_prob\"]`**\n",
        "    - *Relapse chance decreases over time of not smoking*\n",
        "\n",
        "### Service Parameters\n",
        "- Chance a Brief Intervention Made Without MECC: **`{python} session_data[\"mecc_effect\"]`**\n",
        "\n",
        "### MECC Parameters\n",
        " - Chance Making a Brief Intervention After MECC Training: **`{python} session_data[\"base_make_intervention_prob\"]`**\n",
        " - Effect of a Brief Intervention on Chance Making a Quit Attempt: **`{python} session_data[\"intervention_effect\"]`**\n",
        "    - *Numbers less than 1 will decrease the probability*\n",
        "\n",
        "### Simulation Parameters\n",
        " - Random Seed: **`{python} session_data[\"model_seed\"]`**\n",
        " - Number of Months to Simulate: **`{python} session_data[\"num_steps\"]`**\n",
        " - Animation Speed (seconds): **`{python} session_data[\"animation_speed\"]`**\n",
        "\n",
        "### Logic Diagram\n",
        "\n",
        "![Diagram of Agent Model Logic](`{python} create_logic_diagram_SmokeModel(number_labels = True, session_data = session_data)`)\n"
      ],
      "id": "7ad934dd"
    }
